description "Rebel Trooper 

5-life basic infantry units.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
- Shock Baton (Yellow/Cyan Saber)
-- No Saber/Blaster Block
-- No Saber Training
-- Staggers on hit
-- 10% more Kb
-- 50% less Reach
-- 33% more Radius
- DL-44 Blaster Pistol (2)
- DH-17 Blaster Rifle (3)
- Micro-Frag Grenade (1)
-- 28% less Splash Radius
-- Prim only
- V-59 Conc Grenade (1)

^8Attributes:
- Reinforcements (4)
- Close Combat Training (1)
- Assemble (3)"
